# Per-Dockerfile ignore file (BuildKit) for e2e/single.Dockerfile, whose
# context is the repository root. The name is the contract: BuildKit reads
# <dockerfile>.dockerignore, so cork.Dockerfile's copy does not apply here
# and this build would otherwise ship .git -- which also invalidates the
# COPY layer, and so the link step, on every commit or checkout.
.git
bin
**/*.db
**/*.db-wal
**/*.db-shm
**/*.tar.gz
